# rules+skills: paths an apply may change or delete outside chezmoi's managed-file list.
# 1. ~/.agents/skills/<name>: each canonical skill is an exact_ directory, so apply --force deletes
#    any file or link in it that the repo lacks (older versions, local edits, dangling links).
#    Back up the whole directory, not only the managed files.
# 2. ~/.claude/skills/<name>: entries that run_after_20-skills-links may replace with a link.
# One line of each kind per canonical skill (home/dot_agents/skills/exact_<name>).
# scripts/verify.d/20-skills checks both sets.
